Speech_0008L=Is the zodiac all fueled up?
Speech_0009L=Fueled and ready to go.
Speech_0010L=Good. If the Americans find out about this place, they certainly won't let the missile boat out of here intact. We'll take the zodiac and hopefully not get bombed.
